  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "generated" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts genetic-syndrome-to-icd11</b></p><a name=\"genetic-syndrome-to-icd11\"> </a><a name=\"hcgenetic-syndrome-to-icd11\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <code>http://www.orpha.net</code> to <code>http://id.who.int/icd/release/11/mms</code> (International Classification of Diseases, 11th Revision Mortality and Morbidity Statistics (MMS))</p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>870 (Trisomie 21)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD40.0 (Complete trisomy 21)</td></tr><tr><td>881 (Syndrome de Turner)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD50.0 (Turner syndrome)</td></tr><tr><td>567 (Syndrome de délétion 22q11.2)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD44.N0 (CATCH 22 phenotype)</td></tr><tr><td>3380 (Syndrome de trisomie 18)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD40.2 (Complete trisomy 18)</td></tr><tr><td>3378 (Syndrome de trisomie 13)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD40.1 (Complete trisomy 13)</td></tr><tr><td>365 (Glycogénose par déficit en maltase acide)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>5C51.3 (Glycogen storage disease)</td></tr><tr><td>95 (Ataxie de Friedreich)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>8A03.10 (Friedreich ataxia)</td></tr><tr><td>98896 (Dystrophie musculaire de Duchenne)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>8C70.1 (Duchenne muscular dystrophy)</td></tr><tr><td>558 (Syndrome de Marfan)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD28.01 (Marfan syndrome)</td></tr><tr><td>98249 (Syndrome d'Ehlers-Danlos)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD28.1 (Ehlers-Danlos syndrome)</td></tr><tr><td>60030 (Syndrome de Loeys-Dietz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>BD50.Z (Aortic aneurysm or dissection, unspecified)</td></tr><tr><td>648 (Syndrome de Noonan)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD2F.15 (Noonan syndrome)</td></tr><tr><td>805 (Sclérose tubéreuse de Bourneville)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD2D.2 (Tuberous sclerosis)</td></tr><tr><td>904 (Syndrome de Williams)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>LD44.70 (De